--- text
Your order is confirmed

Your order is placed and paid. We charged [CURRENCY] [TOTAL] to your
[CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4] on [ORDER_DATE]. Keep this email as
your record of the order.

Order details

Order number: [ORDER_NUMBER]
Order date: [ORDER_DATE]
Payment method: [CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4]

Items in order [ORDER_NUMBER]

Item: [ITEM_1_NAME]
[ITEM_1_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_1_QTY]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_1_AMOUNT]

Item: [ITEM_2_NAME]
[ITEM_2_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_2_QTY]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_2_AMOUNT]

Order totals

Subtotal: [CURRENCY] [SUBTOTAL]
Shipping: [CURRENCY] [SHIPPING]
Tax: [CURRENCY] [TAX]
Total paid: [CURRENCY] [TOTAL]

Shipping address
[SHIPPING_ADDRESS]

Billing address
[BILLING_ADDRESS]

Delivery is estimated for [DELIVERY_ESTIMATE]. That date is an
estimate, not a guarantee: it can move if the carrier runs late. We
send a separate email when the order ships, with the carrier and a
tracking number.

View your order:

[ORDER_URL]

You can change or cancel this order on the order page until
[CHANGE_DEADLINE]. After that it is with the warehouse and we cannot
stop it, but you can send it back once it arrives.

If a line on this order does not look right, reply to this email, or
write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
